{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} eve mi dönüyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Bugün{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
